XFAIL tests/test_invariants.py::test_warm_start_with_empty_archive_is_the_cold_path[NLSHADE_RSP] - LSHADE._warm_start_population calls self._archive_cap() at lshade.py:939 — one line *before* the `if not pool: return False` bail-out at lshade.py:942.  In NLSHADE_RSP that override draws from self._rng (nl_shade_rsp.py:231, adaptive_archive=True by default), so merely setting warm_start= consumes an RNG draw even when the warm start is abandoned and shifts the entire initial population.  Every paired 'warm vs cold' A/B on these two arms therefore compares two different RNG streams — the DISCOVERY §18 failure mode
